+/**
+ * <favorite-toggle> — an on/off switch for marking an item as a favorite.
+ *
+ * Attributes:
+ *   checked     Boolean. Present when the item is a favorite.
+ *   label       Accessible name, e.g. "Favorite Cold Brew". Defaults to "Favorite".
